  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-bda83a31-7fff-b59e-d73a-4d5b280ef145\">You understand that information is the newest form of wealth in this world, and your skills make you the newest form of thief. You are a hacker: a master of technology and cybersecurity. Some \"white-hats\" use their skills to work with clients (including the megacorps), breaking systems so they can be fixed before they are broken into by \"black-hats\", who work to steal from said clients. Which hat do you wear? More importantly, why did you leave your hacking station to roam the streets?</strong></p><hr /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Skill Proficiencies: </strong>Investigation, plus your choice of Deception or Stealth</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tool Proficiencies: </strong>Hacker's Tools and one type of gaming set</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Languages: </strong>None</p><p><strong>Equipment: </strong>A set of common clothes, a smartphone, Hacker's Tools, a universal cable, a wireless transceiver, and a cryptostick with 500 cp.</p><p><strong>Feature: </strong>@UUID[Compendium.cyberpunk-5e.cyberpunk-backgrounds.Item.KDmRSIidRLa7c4op]{Hacker Central}</p>",
